# Rust build artifacts
/target
Cargo.lock

# A/B fuzzer output (repros/logs — regenerable, not source).
# Glob so format-suffixed run dirs (ab_fuzz_out_ou, ab_fuzz_out_protocol, …) are covered too.
/harness/ab_fuzz_out*
/harness/bridge_ab_fuzz_out*
/harness/sim_bridge_diff_out*
# Throwaway sweep run-output dirs (sweep_pool_gen3ou, sweep_random_cg, sweep_bridge_*, …) —
# generated by the fuzzer sweeps, never source (harness/*.js probes + tests/vectors/* stay tracked).
/harness/sweep_*
